4960       X=3+INT((Y-9)*0.4)
4970       SD=0:IF Y>16 THEN SD=FR*2-1
4980       GFX LINE 8-X+SD,Y,7+X+SD,Y,63
4990     NEXT Y
5000     GFX LINE 6,11,6,20,64:GFX LINE 10,11,10,20,64:GFX LINE 8,13,8,19,64
